Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 apt-notifier - tray applet to notify of system and application updates
Changes:
 apt-notifier (23.03.01) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * fix quick-live-update
   * add check for last apt update run
   * add 03apt-notifier-update-stamp
   * adjust forced check to 3 hours
   * add debhelper-compat (= 13) to build-depends
   * use shutil.which instead of distutils.spawn.find_executable
   * add python3-ewmh as depends to detect fullscreen
   * remove python3-distutils from build-depends
   * translations refresh
